acking-tight" style="font-size:22.959999999999997px">Caption<span class="font-serif font-normal italic">it</span></span></span></a><nav class="hidden items-center gap-6 whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-semibold text-[#FFFFEB]/80 lg:flex xl:gap-7"><a href="#how" class="py-1 hover:text-[#FFFFEB]">How it works</a><a href="#control" class="py-1 hover:text-[#FFFFEB]">Editor</a><a href="#looks" class="py-1 hover:text-[#FFFFEB]">Looks</a><a href="#privacy" class="py-1 hover:text-[#FFFFEB]">On your device</a><a href="#faq" class="py-1 hover:text-[#FFFFEB]">FAQ</a></nav><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><a class="hidden whitespace-nowrap rounded-xl px-3 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-[#FFFFEB]/80 transition hover:text-[#FFFFEB] sm:block" href="/login">Sign in</a><a class="hidden items-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap rounded-full bg-[#34D399] px-4 py-2 text-sm font-bold text-[#141412] sm:flex" href="/start?choose=1">Start free <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><button aria-label="Menu" aria-expanded="false" class="grid h-10 w-10 place-items-center rounded-xl border border-[#FFFFEB]/15 lg:hidden"><span class="relative block h-3 w-4"><span class="absolute left-0 top-0 h-[2px] w-4 bg-[#FFFFEB] transition "></span><span class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 h-[2px] w-4 bg-[#FFFFEB] transition "></span></span></button></div></header></div><section class="relative mx-auto flex min-h-[100svh] w-full max-w-6xl flex-col justify-center px-5 pb-16 pt-[max(7rem,14vh)]"><div class="relative z-10 max-w-2xl"><div data-hero="eyebrow" class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2.5"><span class="font-mono text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#34D399]">Free caption studio · Runs in your browser</span></div><h1 class="font-styled mt-5 text-[clamp(2.6rem,6vw,4.6rem)] font-bold leading-[0.95] tracking-[-0.04em] text-[#FFFFEB]"><span data-hero="word" class="block">Every word,</span><span data-hero="word2" class="font-accent block pr-[0.06em] font-normal italic tracking-[-0.025em] text-[#34D399]">on screen, on time.</span></h1><p data-hero="sub" class="mt-5 max-w-lg text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-[#FFFFEB]/70 sm:text-[17px] font-medium">Captionit turns speech into animated, word-timed captions for Shorts, Reels and TikTok. 150 looks and 14 languages, no watermark, all in the tab you already have open.</p><div data-hero="cta" class="mt-7 flex w-full flex-col gap-3 sm:w-auto sm:flex-row"><a class="flex w-full items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-[#34D399] px-8 py-4 text-base font-bold text-[#141412] sm:w-auto" href="/start?choose=1">Caption your first video free <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a href="#looks" class="w-full rounded-full border border-[#FFFFEB]/15 bg-[#1C1C1A] px-7 py-4 text-center text-base font-semibold text-[#FFFFEB]/80 hover:text-[#FFFFEB] sm:w-auto">Browse the looks</a></div><p data-hero="editor-door" class="mt-3 text-sm text-[#FFFFEB]/60">Just want to edit?<!-- --> <a class="font-semibold text-[#FFFFEB]/85 underline decoration-[#FFA946] decoration-2 underline-offset-4 hover:text-[#FFFFEB]" href="/start?mode=editor">Open the plain editor — no captions</a></p><p data-hero="points" class="mt-6 font-mono text-xs tracking-wide text-[#FFFFEB]/50">150 looks · 14 languages · No watermark</p><p data-hero="claim" aria-label="95% Hinglish caption accurate. Captionit&#x27;s claim for Hindi-English speech." class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-2 gap-y-1"><span aria-hidden="true" class="font-styled text-2xl font-bold text-[#34D399] sm:text-3xl">0<!-- -->%</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="text-base font-bold text-[#FFFFEB] sm:text-lg">Hinglish caption accurate</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="w-full text-xs leading-relaxed text-[#FFFFEB]/50 sm:w-auto">Captionit’s claim for Hindi-English speech. Try it on your own clip.</span></p></div><div class="relative z-0 mt-12 w-full"><div class="relative mx-auto w-full max-w-6xl select-none px-2"><div role="img" aria-label="A rotating showcase of trending caption templates: Scribble Ring, Typed Caret, Amber Sweep Box, Slice Signal, Karaoke Pill, Emerald Karaoke Pro, Jumping Box, Bouncy Single Word, Metal Slam + Script, Comic Tilt" class="relative mx-auto h-[320px] cursor-grab overflow-hidden active:cursor-grabbing sm:h-[360px]" style="perspective:1400px;touch-action:none"><div class="absolute inset-0" style="transform-style:preserve-3d"><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute left-1/2 top-1/2 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-[#FFFFEB]/10 bg-[#1C1C1A] shadow-[0_24px_50px_-24px_rgba(0,0,0,0.7)]" style="width:288px;transform:translate(-50%, -50%) rotateY(0deg) translateZ(486px);backface-visibility:hidden"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2 px-3 pt-2.5"><span class="truncate text-[13px] font-bold text-[#FFFFEB]">Scribble Ring</span><span class="shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#FFA946] px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#141412]">Trending</span></div><div class="mt-2"><div class="relative aspect-[8/3] overflow-hidden bg-black"><div class="flex h-full w-full items-center justify-center bg-black px-3 text-center text-[22px] leading-tight"><span style="font-family:&#x27;Caveat&#x27;, system-ui, sans-serif;font-weight:700;color:#FFFFFF;text-transform:none">Watch this<!-- --> <span style="color:#FFD400">now</span></span></div></div></div><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 px-3 py-2.5"><span class="rounded-md bg-[#232320] px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-[#B4B4AA]">Handwritten</span><span class="rounded-md bg-[#232320] px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-[#B4B4AA]">Scribble ring</span></div></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute left-1/2 top-1/2 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-[#FFFFEB]/10 bg-[#1C1C1A] shadow-[0_24px_50px_-24px_rgba(0,0,0,0.7)]" style="width:288px;transform:translate(-50%, -50%) rotateY(36deg) translateZ(486px);backface-visibility:hidden"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2 px-3 pt-2.5"><span class="truncate text-[13px] 