iv></div><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 px-3 py-2.5"><span class="rounded-md bg-[#232320] px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-[#B4B4AA]">One word</span><span class="rounded-md bg-[#232320] px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-[#B4B4AA]">3D shadow</span></div></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute left-1/2 top-1/2 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-[#FFFFEB]/10 bg-[#1C1C1A] shadow-[0_24px_50px_-24px_rgba(0,0,0,0.7)]" style="width:288px;transform:translate(-50%, -50%) rotateY(288deg) translateZ(486px);backface-visibility:hidden"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2 px-3 pt-2.5"><span class="truncate text-[13px] font-bold text-[#FFFFEB]">Metal Slam + Script</span><span class="shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#FFA946] px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#141412]">Trending</span></div><div class="mt-2"><div class="relative aspect-[8/3] overflow-hidden bg-black"><div class="flex h-full w-full items-center justify-center bg-black px-3 text-center text-[22px] leading-tight"><span style="font-family:&#x27;Anton&#x27;, system-ui, sans-serif;font-weight:400;color:#FFFFFF;text-transform:uppercase">Watch this<!-- --> <span style="color:#FFFFFF">now</span></span></div></div></div><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 px-3 py-2.5"><span class="rounded-md bg-[#232320] px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-[#B4B4AA]">Letter slam</span><span class="rounded-md bg-[#232320] px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-[#B4B4AA]">Script</span></div></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute left-1/2 top-1/2 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-[#FFFFEB]/10 bg-[#1C1C1A] shadow-[0_24px_50px_-24px_rgba(0,0,0,0.7)]" style="width:288px;transform:translate(-50%, -50%) rotateY(324deg) translateZ(486px);backface-visibility:hidden"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2 px-3 pt-2.5"><span class="truncate text-[13px] font-bold text-[#FFFFEB]">Comic Tilt</span><span class="shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#FFA946] px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#141412]">Trending</span></div><div class="mt-2"><div class="relative aspect-[8/3] overflow-hidden bg-black"><div class="flex h-full w-full items-center justify-center bg-black px-3 text-center text-[22px] leading-tight"><span style="font-family:&#x27;Bangers&#x27;, system-ui, sans-serif;font-weight:400;color:#FFE600;text-transform:uppercase">WATCH<!-- --> <span style="color:#FFFFFF">now</span></span></div></div></div><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 px-3 py-2.5"><span class="rounded-md bg-[#232320] px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-[#B4B4AA]">One word</span><span class="rounded-md bg-[#232320] px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-[#B4B4AA]">Tilt</span></div></div></div></div></div><p class="mt-3 text-center text-xs text-[#FFFFEB]/50">Drag to spin the ring — live previews of the trending caption looks.</p></div></section><section class="px-4 pb-24 sm:pb-32"><div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl"><div data-reveal="true" class="max-w-2xl"><h2 class="font-styled text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-[#FFFFEB] sm:text-4xl">Start with what you need.</h2></div><div data-reveal="true" class="mt-8 border-t border-[#FFFFEB]/10"><a class="group grid grid-cols-1 gap-1 border-b border-[#FFFFEB]/10 py-6 sm:grid-cols-12 sm:items-baseline sm:gap-6" href="/start?mode=captions"><span class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#34D399] sm:col-span-2">Captions</span><span class="font-styled text-xl font-bold text-[#FFFFEB] sm:col-span-4">Add captions</span><span class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#FFFFEB]/70 sm:col-span-5">Upload a clip and get word-timed captions in one of 150 looks.</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="hidden text-right text-[#FFFFEB]/50 transition group-hover:text-[#FFFFEB] sm:col-span-1 sm:block">→</span></a><a class="group grid grid-cols-1 gap-1 border-b border-[#FFFFEB]/10 py-6 sm:grid-cols-12 sm:items-baseline sm:gap-6" href="/start?mode=editor"><span class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#34D399] sm:col-span-2">Editor</span><span class="font-styled text-xl font-bold text-[#FFFFEB] sm:col-span-4">Edit a video</span><span class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#FFFFEB]/70 sm:col-span-5">The plain editor, no captions attached. Cut, trim and arrange.</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="hidden text-right text-[#FFFFEB]/50 transition group-hover:text-[#FFFFEB] sm:col-span-1 sm:block">→</span></a><a class="group grid grid-cols-1 gap-1 border-b border-[#FFFFEB]/10 py-6 sm:grid-cols-12 sm:items-baseline sm:gap-6" href="/start?mode=ai-edit"><span class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#34D399] sm:col-span-2">AI Edit</span><span class="font-styled text-xl font-bold text-[#FFFFEB] sm:col-span-4">AI Edit</span><span class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#FFFFEB]/70 sm:col-span-5">Describe the edit, then approve the plan before anything is applied.</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="hidden text-right text-[#FFFFEB]/50 transition group-hover:text-[#FFFFEB] sm:col-span-1 sm:block">→</span></a><a class="group grid grid-cols-1 gap-1 border-b border-[#FFFFEB]/10 py-6 sm:grid-cols-12 sm:items-baseline sm:gap-6" href="/transcribe"><span class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#34D399] sm:col-span-2">Transcribe</span><span class="font-styled text-xl font-bold text-[#FFFFEB] sm:col-span-4">Transcribe</span><span class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#FFFFEB]/70 sm:col-span-5">A file in, a timed transcript out, in 14 languages.</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="hidden text-right text-[#FFFFEB]/50 transition group-hover:text-[#FFFFEB] sm:col-span-1 sm:block">→</span></a><a class="group grid grid-cols-1 gap-1 border-b border-[#FFFFEB]/10 py-6 sm:grid-cols-12 sm:items-baseline sm:gap-6" href="/auto-caption-generator"><span class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#34D399] sm:col-span-2">Captions</span><span class="font-styled text-xl font-bold text-[#FFFFEB] sm:col-span-4">Auto caption generator</span><span class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#FFFFEB]/70 sm:col-span-5">How automatic captions work, what they cost, and what they cannot do.</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="hidden text-right text-[#FFFFEB]/50 transition group-hover:text-[#FFFFEB] sm:col-span-1 sm:block">→</span></a></div></div></section><section id="how" class="relative px-4 py-24 sm:py-32"><div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl grid-cols-1 gap-12 lg:grid-cols-12"><div data-reveal="true" class="lg:col-span-4"><div class="lg:sticky lg:top-28"><h2 class="font-styled text-4xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight text-[#FFFFEB] sm:text-5xl">Four steps, <em class="font-normal italic text-[#34D399]">then post.</em></h2><p class="mt-4 max-w-sm text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#FFFFEB]/70">No timeline to set up. No project files to manage.</p></div></div><div class="lg:col-span-8"><div class="space-y-12"><div data-step="true"><p class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#34D399]">Step <!-- -->1</p><h3 class="mt-1 font-styled text-2xl font-bold text-[#FFFFEB]">Drop in a clip</h3><p class="mt-2 max-w-md text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#FFFFEB]/70">One video file, straight from your camera roll. The file stays on your device.</p><div class="mt-4"><div class="rounded-2xl border border-dashed border-[#FFFFEB]/20 bg-[#1C1C1A] p-5 shadow-sm"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3"><span class="font-mono text-xs text-[#FFFFEB]/60">drop your clip here</span><span class="rounded-full bg-[#1E1E1B] border border-[#FFFFEB]/10 px-3 py-1 font-mono text-[11px] font-semibold text-[#34D399]">reel-draft.mp4</span></div><div class="mt-4 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#FFFFEB]/5 overflow-hidden"><div class="h-full w-[72%] rounded-full bg-[#34D399]"></div></div></div></div></div><div data-step="true"><p class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#34D399]">Step <!-- -->2</p><h3 class="mt-1 font-styled text-2xl font-bold text-[#FFFFEB]">Speech becomes timed words</h3><p class="mt-2 max-w-md text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#FFFFEB]/70">The speech model runs in your browser and stamps every word with its moment. Fix a name or drop a filler before anything is styled.</p><div class="mt-4"><div class="rounded-2xl bg-[#1C1C1A] border border-[#FFFFEB]/10 divide-y divide-[#FFFFEB]/5 shadow-sm overflow-hidden"><div class="flex items-baseline gap-4 px-5 py-3 "><span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-[#FFFFEB]/50 shrink-0">00:00.42</span><span class="text-[13px] text-[#FFFFEB]/75">the first three seconds decide</span></div><div class="flex items-baseline gap-4 px-5 py-3 bg-[#252B26]/30"><span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-[#FFFFEB]/50 shrink-0">00:02.10</span><span class="text-[13px] text-[#FFFFEB] font-bold">whether anyone stays,</span></div><div class="flex items-baseline gap-4 px-5 py-3 "><span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-[#FFFFEB]/50 shrink-0">00:03.65</span><span class="text-[13px] text-[#FFFFEB]/75">so make them unmistakable.</span></div></div></div></div><div data-step="true"><p class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#34D399]">Step <!-- -->3</p><h3 class="mt-1 font-styled text-2xl font-bold text-[#FFFFEB]">Choose the look, place the box</h3><p class="mt-2 max-w-md text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#FFFFEB]/70">Start from 150 animated looks. Drag the caption box clear of faces and buttons, then tune the hero word and the body line apart.</p><div class="mt-4"><div class="rounded-2xl bg-[#1C1C1A] border border-[#FFFFEB]/10 p-5 space-y-4 shadow-sm"><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2"><span class="rounded-full px-3.5 py-1 text-[11px] font-bold transition bg-[#262622] text-[#FFFFEB]">Hormozi Box</span><span class="rounded-full px-3.5 py-1 text-[11px] font-bold transition bg-[#1E1E1B] border border-[#FFFFEB]/10 text-[#FFFFEB]/70">Karaoke Fill</span><span class="rounded-full px-3.5 py-1 text-[11px] font-bold transition bg-[#1E1E1B] border border-[#FFFFEB]/10 text-[#FFFFEB]/70">Beast Bounce</span><span class="rounded-full px-3.5 py-1 text-[11px] font-bold transition bg-[#1E1E1B] border border-[#FFFFEB]/10 text-[#FFFFEB]/70">Emerald</span></div><div class="relative h-20 rounded-xl bg-[#262622] overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center"><div class="w-[68%] h-[56%] border-2 border-dashed border-[#FFA946] rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center bg-[#FFA946]/10"><span class="font-styled text-xs font-bold text-[#FFFFEB]">caption box · drag me</span></div></div></div></div></div><div data-step="true"><p class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#34D399]">Step <!-- -->4</p><h3 class="mt-1 font-styled text-2xl font-bold text-[#FFFFEB]">Export the finished video</h3><p class="mt-2 max-w-md text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#FFFFEB]/70">The same renderer that showed you the preview burns the captions into a 1080p vertical MP4. What you saw is what posts.</p><div class="mt-4"><div class="rounded-2xl bg-[#1C1C1A] border border-[#FFFFEB]/10 p-5 space-y-3.5 shadow-sm"><div class="flex items-center justify-between font-mono text-[11px] text-[#FFFFEB]/60"><span>remotion render · 1080×1920 · 60fps</span><span class="text-[#34D399] font-semibold">100% ready</span></div><div class="h-2 rounded-full bg-[#FFFFEB]/5 overflow-hidden"><div class="h-full w-full rounded-full bg-[#34D399]"></div></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between pt-1"><span class="font-styled text-xs font-bold text-[#FFFFEB]">Export burned-in MP4</span><span class="rounded-full bg-[#FFFFEB] text-[#141412] px-3.5 py-1 text-xs font-bold shadow-sm">Download MP4</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id="transcribe" class="px-4 py-24 sm:py-32 border-t border-[#FFFFEB]/10"><div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl"><div data-reveal="true" class="grid items-center gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2"><div class="rounded-[2rem] border border-[#FFFFEB]/10 bg-[#1E1E1B] p-6 sm:p-8 lg:order-1"><p class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-widest text-[#FFFFEB]/50">Transcript · timed segments</p><div class="mt-5 space-y-3"><div class="flex items-baseline gap-3 rounded-xl border border-[#FFFFEB]/10 bg-[#262622] px-4 py-3.5"><span class="shrink-0 font-mono text-sm font-semibold text-[#34D399]">0:00</span><span class="min-w-0 text-sm text-[#FFFFEB]/80">hello, and welcome back to the show</span></div><div class="flex items-baseline gap-3 rounded-xl border border-[#FFFFEB]/10 bg-[#262622] px-4 py-3.5"><span class="shrink-0 font-mono text-sm font-semibold text-[#34D399]">0:04</span><span class="min-w-0 text-sm text-[#FFFFEB]/80">today we are looking at three free tools</span></div><div class="flex items-baseline gap-3 rounded-xl border border-[#FFFFEB]/10 bg-[#262622] px-4 py-3.5"><span class="shrink-0 font-mono text-sm font-semibold text-[#34D399]">0:09</span><span class="min-w-0 text-sm text-[#FFFFEB]/80">the first one runs entirely in your browser</span></div></div><p class="mt-5 font-mono text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-[#FFFFEB]/45">TXT · SRT · VTT downloads · 14 languages</p></div><div class="lg:order-2"><h2 class="font-styled text-4xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight text-[#FFFFEB] sm:text-5xl">A file in, <em class="font-normal italic text-[#34D399]">a transcript out.</em></h2><p class="mt-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-[#FFFFEB]/70">Transcribe turns a video or audio file into a timed transcript, in 14 languages, with the speech model running in your browser. Copy it, or download it as TXT, SRT or VTT.</p><a class="mt-7 inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-[#34D399] px-6 py-3.5 text-base font-bold text-[#141412]" href="/transcribe">Open Transcribe <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></div></div></section><section id="motion" class="px-4 py-24 sm:py-32 border-t border-[#FFFFEB]/10"><div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl"><div data-reveal="true" class="max-w-2xl"><h2 class="font-styled text-4xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight text-[#FFFFEB] sm:text-5xl">Motion Studio: graphics that <em class="font-normal italic text-[#34D399]">move.</em></h2><p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[#FFFFEB]/70">Subscribe pills, follow cards, counters and titles — animated graphics you customise with your own words and colour, then drop into a project. These four are playing live, exactly as they render in your video.</p><a class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-[#34D399] px-6 py-3.5 text-base font-bold text-[#141412]" href="/motion">Open Motion Studio <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div><div class="mt-10 flex gap-4 overflow-x-auto pb-2 [scrollbar-width:thin]"><a class="w-[280px] shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-[#FFFFEB]/10 bg-[#1C1C1A] transition hover:border-[#FFFFEB]/25 sm:w-[320px]" aria-label="Customise Subscribe Pill" href="/motion/subscribe-pill"><!--$!--><template data-dgst="BAILOUT_TO_CLIENT_SIDE_RENDERING"></template><div class="aspect-[700/360] w-full animate-pulse bg-[#141412]"></div><!--/$--><span class="block px-4 py-3"><span class="block font-styled text-[15px] font-bold text-[#FFFFEB]">Subscribe Pill</span><span class="mt-0.5 block text-[13px] leading-snug text-[#FFFFEB]/65">Pill that flips to its second label when the pointer taps it.</span></span></a><a class="w-[280px] shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-[#FFFFEB]/10 bg-[#1C1C1A] transition hover:border-[#FFFFEB]/25 sm:w-[320px]" aria-label="Customise Counter / Odometer" href="/motion/counter"><!--$!--><template data-dgst="BAILOUT_TO_CLIENT_SIDE_RENDERING"></template><div class="aspect-[700/360] w-full animate-pulse bg-[#141412]"></div><!--/$--><span class="block px-4 py-3"><span class="block font-styled text-[15px] font-bold text-[#FFFFEB]">Counter / Odometer</span><span class="mt-0.5 block text-[13px] leading-snug text-[#FFFFEB]/65">Digits roll up in per-digit odometer columns.</span></span></a><a class="w-[280px] shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-[#FFFFEB]/10 bg-[#1C1C1A] transition hover:border-[#FFFFEB]/25 sm:w-[320px]" aria-label="Customise Search Bar" href="/motion/search-bar"><!--$!--><template data-dgst="BAILOUT_TO_CLIENT_SIDE_RENDERING"></template><div class="aspect-[700/360] w-full animate-pulse bg-[#141412]"></div><!--/$--><span class="block px-4 py-3"><span class="block font-styled text-[15px] font-bold text-[#FFFFEB]">Search Bar</span><span class="mt-0.5 block text-[13px] leading-snug text-[#FFFFEB]/65">Search field that types its query, then drops in a result row.</span></span></a><a class="w-[280px] shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-[#FFFFEB]/10 bg-[#1C1C1A] transition hover:border-[#FFFFEB]/25 sm:w-[320px]" aria-label="Customise Profile Card" href="/motion/profile-card"><!--$!--><template data-dgst="BAILOUT_TO_CLIENT_SIDE_RENDERING"></template><div class="aspect-[700/360] w-full animate-pulse bg-[#141412]"></div><!--/$--><span class="block px-4 py-3"><span class="block font-styled text-[15px] font-bold text-[#FFFFEB]">Profile Card</span><span class="mt-0.5 block text-[13px] leading-snug text-[#FFFFEB]/65">Avatar card with animated ring, follower row and a flipping Follow button.</span></span></a></div></div></section><section id="ai-edit" class="px-4 py-24 sm:py-32 border-t border-[#FFFFEB]/10"><div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl"><div data-reveal="true" class="grid items-center gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2"><div class="lg:order-1"><!--$!--><template data-dgst="BAILOUT_TO_CLIENT_SIDE_RENDERING"></template><div class="aspect-[4/3] w-full animate-pulse rounded-[2rem] bg-[#1C1C1A]"></div><!--/$--></div><div class="lg:order-2"><span class="rounded-md bg-[#34D399] px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#141412]">New</span><h2 class="font-styled mt-4 text-4xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight text-[#FFFFEB] sm:text-5xl">Describe the edit. <em class="font-normal italic text-[#34D399]">Check the plan. Keep what works.</em></h2><p class="mt-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-[#FFFFEB]/70">Choose a look, add a line of instruction if you like, and AI Edit drafts the whole edit — the caption look, punch-in zooms, key words and a hook — as a checklist. Nothing is applied until you approve it, and every step can be previewed and undone.</p><a class="mt-7 inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-[#34D399] px-6 py-3.5 text-base font-bold text-[#141412]" href="/start?choose=1">Try AI Edit <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></div></div></section><section id="control" class="px-4 py-24 sm:py-32 border-t border-[#FFFFEB]/10"><div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl"><div data-reveal="true" class="max-w-2xl"><h2 class="font-styled text-4xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight text-[#FFFFEB] sm:text-5xl">You stay in charge of <em class="font-normal italic text-[#34D399]">every word.</em></h2><p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[#FFFFEB]/70">The first pass is automatic. After that, every word, break, position and motion curve is yours to change.</p></div><div class="mt-12 border-t border-[#FFFFEB]/10"><div data-reveal="true" class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-1 border-b border-[#FFFFEB]/10 py-6 sm:grid-cols-12 sm:gap-6"><span class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold text-[#34D399] sm:col-span-1">01</span><h3 class="font-styled text-lg font-bold text-[#FFFFEB] sm:col-span-4">Move the caption box</h3><p class="max-w-[54ch] text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#FFFFEB]/70 sm:col-span-7">Drag and resize the caption region anywhere in the frame, clear of faces, product shots or platform buttons. The export honours it to the pixel.</p></div><div data-reveal="true" class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-1 border-b border-[#FFFFEB]/10 py-6 sm:grid-cols-12 sm:gap-6"><span class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold text-[#34D399] sm:col-span-1">02</span><h3 class="font-styled text-lg font-bold text-[#FFFFEB] sm:col-span-4">Re-cut the timing</h3><p class="max-w-[54ch] text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#FFFFEB]/70 sm:col-span-7">A word-level timeline lets you nudge any word&#x27;s in and out points when the delivery needs a different beat than the transcript suggests.</p></div><div data-reveal="true" class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-1 border-b border-[#FFFFEB]/10 py-6 sm:grid-cols-12 sm:gap-6"><span class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold text-[#34D399] sm:col-span-1">03</span><h3 class="font-styled text-lg font-bold text-[#FFFFEB] sm:col-span-4">Fix the transcript first</h3><p class="max-w-[54ch] text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#FFFFEB]/70 sm:col-span-7">Correct names, drop filler words and merge fragments before styling, so the animation never amplifies a typo.</p></div><div data-reveal="true" class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-1 border-b border-[#FFFFEB]/10 py-6 sm:grid-cols-12 sm:gap-6"><span class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold text-[#34D399] sm:col-span-1">04</span><h3 class="font-styled text-lg font-bold text-[#FFFFEB] sm:col-span-4">Style the hero word apart</h3><p class="max-w-[54ch] text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#FFFFEB]/70 sm:col-span-7">The emphasized word and the supporting line carry their own fonts, sizes and colours. Tune one without touching the other.</p></div><div data-reveal="true" class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-1 border-b border-[#FFFFEB]/10 py-6 sm:grid-cols-12 sm:gap-6"><span class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold text-[#34D399] sm:col-span-1">05</span><h3 class="font-styled text-lg font-bold text-[#FFFFEB] sm:col-span-4">Every export is saved</h3><p class="max-w-[54ch] text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#FFFFEB]/70 sm:col-span-7">Each render lands in the project&#x27;s export history with its settings, so last week&#x27;s look is one click to reproduce.</p></div></div></div></section><div id="looks" class="scroll-mt-20"><div class="h-screen w-full bg-[#141412]"></div></div><section id="privacy" class="px-4 pb-24 sm:pb-32"><div data-reveal="true" class="relative mx-auto max-w-6xl overflow-hidden rounded-[2.5rem] border border-[#FFFFEB]/12 bg-[#1E1E1B] px-6 py-14 text-[#FFFFEB] sm:px-14 sm:py-20 shadow-2xl"><div class="relative grid items-center gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2"><div class="min-w-0 lg:h-full lg:order-1"><div class="relative flex h-full min-h-[240px] w-full flex-col justify-center rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-[#141412] p-6 font-mono text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-[#FFFFEB]/90 shadow-[0_24px_50px_-20px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5)] sm:p-8"><p class="flex items-baseline gap-3 border-b border-white/5 py-3 last:border-0"><span class="text-[#34D399]">✓</span><span class="text-[#FFFFEB]/55">Speech recognition</span><span class="ml-auto text-right">on this device</span></p><p class="flex items-baseline gap-3 border-b border-white/5 py-3 last:border-0"><span class="text-[#34D399]">✓</span><span class="text-[#FFFFEB]/55">Your video file</span><span class="ml-auto text-right">never uploaded for captions or export</span></p><p class="flex items-baseline gap-3 border-b border-white/5 py-3 last:border-0"><span class="text-[#34D399]">✓</span><span class="text-[#FFFFEB]/55">MP4 export</span><span class="ml-auto text-right">made in this tab</span></p><p class="flex items-baseline gap-3 border-b border-white/5 py-3 last:border-0"><span class="text-[#34D399]">✓</span><span class="text-[#FFFFEB]/55">Install</span><span class="ml-auto text-right">nothing, ever</span></p></div></div><div class="lg:pr-8 lg:order-2"><h2 class="font-styled text-4xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">Your video <em class="font-normal italic text-[#34D399]">never leaves</em> this tab.</h2><p class="mt-6 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed text-[#FFFFEB]/75">Transcription, styling and the MP4 export all run in the browser tab you already have open, on your phone or your laptop. No app, no plugin, no per-minute bill.</p></div></div></div></section><section id="faq" class="px-4 pb-24 sm:pb-32"><div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl"><div data-reveal="true" class="max-w-2xl"><h2 class="font-styled text-4xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight text-[#FFFFEB] sm:text-5xl">Questions, answered.</h2><p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[#FFFFEB]/70">The things people ask before their first caption.</p></div><div data-reveal="true" class="mt-10 border-t border-[#FFFFEB]/10"><div class="border-b border-[#FFFFEB]/10"><button aria-expanded="true" class="flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left"><span class="font-styled text-lg font-bold text-[#FFFFEB] sm:text-xl">Is Captionit really free?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 font-mono text-lg text-[#34D399]">−</span></button><p class="max-w-3xl pb-6 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#FFFFEB]/80 sm:text-base">Yes. Captions, every look, the full editor and MP4 and SRT exports are free, with no watermark. Free videos can be up to 5 minutes long. Paid 30-day passes raise the limits — see Pricing.</p></div><div class="border-b border-[#FFFFEB]/10"><button aria-expanded="false" class="flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left"><span class="font-styled text-lg font-bold text-[#FFFFEB] sm:text-xl">Is my video uploaded anywhere?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 font-mono text-lg text-[#34D399]">+</span></button></div><div class="border-b border-[#FFFFEB]/10"><button aria-expanded="false" class="flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left"><span class="font-styled text-lg font-bold text-[#FFFFEB] sm:text-xl">Will Captionit work with vertical 9:16 Shorts, Reels, and TikToks?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 font-mono text-lg text-[#34D399]">+</span></button></div><div class="border-b border-[#FFFFEB]/10"><button aria-expanded="false" class="flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left"><span class="font-styled text-lg font-bold text-[#FFFFEB] sm:text-xl">How is Captionit different from basic CapCut or Premiere captions?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 font-mono text-lg text-[#34D399]">+</span></button></div><div class="border-b border-[#FFFFEB]/10"><button aria-expanded="false" class="flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left"><span class="font-styled text-lg font-bold text-[#FFFFEB] sm:text-xl">Do I need to install anything?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 font-mono text-lg text-[#34D399]">+</span></button></div><div class="border-b border-[#FFFFEB]/10"><button aria-expanded="false" class="flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left"><span class="font-styled text-lg font-bold text-[#FFFFEB] sm:text-xl">Can I customize the font, colors, and animations?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 font-mono text-lg text-[#34D399]">+</span></button></div><div class="border-b border-[#FFFFEB]/10"><button aria-expanded="false" class="flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left"><span class="font-styled text-lg font-bold text-[#FFFFEB] sm:text-xl">Does it support Hindi and Hinglish?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 font-mono text-lg text-[#34D399]">+</span></button></div><div class="border-b border-[#FFFFEB]/10"><button aria-expanded="false" class="flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left"><span class="font-styled text-lg font-bold text-[#FFFFEB] sm:text-xl">What export formats are supported?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 font-mono text-lg text-[#34D399]">+</span></button></div></div></div></section><section class="px-4 pb-16"><div data-reveal="true" class="relative mx-auto max-w-6xl overflow-hidden rounded-[2.5rem] bg-[#0F3D2E] px-6 py-14 text-[#FFFFEB] shadow-2xl sm:px-12 sm:py-16"><div class="flex flex-col gap-8 lg:flex-row lg:items-center lg:justify-between"><div class="max-w-xl"><h2 class="font-styled text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">Start with one clip.</h2><p class="mt-4 max-w-lg text-base leading-relaxed text-[#FFFFEB]/70 sm:text-lg">Upload a video and see your words on screen in under a minute. Free, no watermark.</p></div><a class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-[#34D399] px-8 py-4 text-base font-bold text-[#141412] sm:text-lg" href="/start?choose=1">Create free captions <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></div></section><footer class="relative overflow-hidden border-t border-[#FFFFEB]/10 bg-[#1E1E1B] pt-20 pb-10 text-[#FFFFEB]"><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-6 gap-y-10 md:grid-cols-4 lg:gap-16 pb-16"><div class="space-y-4"><h3 class="font-mono text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#FFFFEB]/50">Product</h3><ul class="space-y-0.5 text-sm text-[#FFFFEB]/75 lg:space-y-2.5"><li><a class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center transition-colors hover:text-[#34D399] hover:underline underline-offset-4 lg:min-h-0" href="/#how">How it works</a></li><li><a class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center transition-colors hover:text-[#34D399] hover:underline underline-offset-4 lg:min-h-0" href="/pricing">Pricing</a></li><li><a class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center transition-colors hover:text-[#34D399] hover:underline underline-offset-4 lg:min-h-0" href="/auto-caption-generator">Auto caption generator</a></li><li><a class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center transition-colors hover:text-[#34D399] hover:underline underline-offset-4 lg:min-h-0" href="/transcribe">Transcribe</a></li><li><a class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center transition-colors hover:text-[#34D399] hover:underline underline-offset-4 lg:min-h-0" href="/#looks">Looks gallery</a></li><li><a class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center transition-colors hover:text-[#34D399] hover:underline underline-offset-4 lg:min-h-0" href="/#control">Precision controls</a></li></ul></div><div class="space-y-4"><h3 class="font-mono text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#FFFFEB]/50">For creators</h3><ul class="space-y-0.5 text-sm text-[#FFFFEB]/75 lg:space-y-2.5"><li><a class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center transition-colors hover:text-[#34D399] hover:underline underline-offset-4 lg:min-h-0" href="/#looks">Looks for Shorts, Reels &amp; TikTok</a></li><li><a class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center transition-colors hover:text-[#34D399] hover:underline underline-offset-4 lg:min-h-0" href="/#faq">Hindi &amp; Hinglish support</a></li><li><a class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center transition-colors hover:text-[#34D399] hover:underline underline-offset-4 lg:min-h-0" href="/#faq">Export formats, incl. overlays</a></li></ul></div><div class="space-y-4"><h3 class="font-mono text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#FFFFEB]/50">Help</h3><ul class="space-y-0.5 text-sm text-[#FFFFEB]/75 lg:space-y-2.5"><li><a class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center transition-colors hover:text-[#34D399] hover:underline underline-offset-4 lg:min-h-0" href="/#faq">Frequently asked questions</a></li><li><a class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center transition-colors hover:text-[#34D399] hover:underline underline-offset-4 lg:min-h-0" href="/dashboard">Project studio</a></li></ul></div><div class="space-y-4"><h3 class="font-mono text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#FFFFEB]/50">Company</h3><ul class="space-y-0.5 text-sm text-[#FFFFEB]/75 lg:space-y-2.5"><li><a class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center transition-colors hover:text-[#34D399] hover:underline underline-offset-4 lg:min-h-0" href="/about">About</a></li><li><a class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center transition-colors hover:text-[#34D399] hover:underline underline-offset-4 lg:min-h-0" href="mailto:work.techhacksai@gmail.com">Support</a></li><li><a class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center transition-colors hover:text-[#34D399] hover:underline underline-offset-4 lg:min-h-0" href="/login">Sign in to app</a></li><li><a class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center transition-colors hover:text-[#34D399] hover:underline underline-offset-4 lg:min-h-0" href="/terms">Terms of service</a></li><li><a class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center transition-colors hover:text-[#34D399] hover:underline underline-offset-4 lg:min-h-0" href="/privacy">Privacy policy</a></li><li><a class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center transition-colors hover:text-[#34D399] hover:underline underline-offset-4 lg:min-h-0" href="/cookies">Cookie policy</a></li><li><a class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center transition-colors hover:text-[#34D399] hover:underline underline-offset-4 lg:min-h-0" href="/acceptable-use">Acceptable use</a></li><li><a class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center transition-colors hover:text-[#34D399] hover:underline underline-offset-4 lg:min-h-0" href="/copyright">Copyright &amp; takedowns</a></li><li><a class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center transition-colors hover:text-[#34D399] hover:underline underline-offset-4 lg:min-h-0" href="/subprocessors">Subprocessors</a></li><li><a class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center transition-colors hover:text-[#34D399] hover:underline underline-offset-4 lg:min-h-0" href="/credits">Credits &amp; licences</a></li></ul></div></div><div class="pt-10 sm:pt-14 border-t border-[#FFFFEB]/10 flex items-center justify-between overflow-hidden select-none"><a class="group flex items-center gap-3 sm:gap-5 w-full" href="/"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" class="h-12 w-auto shrink-0 sm:h-20 md:h-28 lg:h-36" aria-hidden="true" role="presentation"><rect x="16" y="32" width="46" height="13" rx="6.5" fill="#FFFFEB"></rect><rect x="16" y="55" width="60" height="13" rx="6.5" fill="#FFFFEB"></rect><rect x="80" y="55" width="13" height="13" rx="2.5" fill="#FFA946"></rect></svg><span class="font-styled font-black text-4xl sm:text-7xl md:text-8xl lg:text-[130px] leading-none tracking-tighter text-[#FFFFEB]">Caption<span class="font-serif font-normal italic text-[#FFFFEB]">it</span></span></a></div><div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-[#FFFFEB]/10 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-3 text-xs text-[#FFFFEB]/60"><span>© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> <!-- -->Captionit<!-- -->. All rights reserved.</span><span class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-[#34D399]"></span>Zero Server Cost · Local Hardware-Acceler